msgid "The coordinate system (e.g. WGS84, UTM) of the orthophotos should be the same as the coordinate system defining the GeoJSON files. If the coordinate system is \"Pixels\", then the GeoJSON files should define the pixel positions of the plot-polygons relative to the uploaded images."
